### 外部前置条件：需要 Elasticsearch 8.17.0 已在 http://localhost:9200 运行。
### 本文件按“索引 -> 文档 -> 查询 -> 更新 -> 删除”的顺序复习，未在当前仓库运行验证。

### 1. 创建索引：text 会分词，keyword 只做精确匹配
PUT http://localhost:9200/article
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "title": { "type": "text" },
      "content": { "type": "text" },
      "author": { "type": "keyword" },
      "createTime": { "type": "date" },
      "viewCount": { "type": "integer" }
    }
  }
}

### 2. 新增指定 ID 的文档
PUT http://localhost:9200/article/_doc/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "RAG 混合检索实战",
  "content": "ES 负责关键词检索，Milvus 负责向量语义检索",
  "author": "AI开发",
  "createTime": "2026-04-26",
  "viewCount": 256
}

### 3. match：对 text 字段执行全文分词检索
GET http://localhost:9200/article/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match": { "content": "RAG 向量 检索" }
  }
}

### 4. term：对 keyword 字段执行精确匹配
GET http://localhost:9200/article/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "term": { "author": "AI开发" }
  }
}

### 5. 分页并按浏览量降序
GET http://localhost:9200/article/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": 0,
  "size": 10,
  "sort": [{ "viewCount": "desc" }],
  "query": { "match_all": {} }
}

### 6. 局部更新（不会覆盖未列出的字段）
POST http://localhost:9200/article/_update/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doc": {
    "title": "RAG 混合检索高级实战",
    "viewCount": 999
  }
}

### 7. 按 ID 删除文档
DELETE http://localhost:9200/article/_doc/1001

### 8. 删除索引（破坏性操作，仅在确认无需保留练习数据后手动执行）
DELETE http://localhost:9200/article
